<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-SAUDI ARABIA BEAT IRAN 4-3 ON PENALTIES IN ASIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAUDI ARABIA BEAT IRAN 4-3 ON PENALTIES IN ASIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia beat Iran 4-3 on</p>
<p>penalties after a goalless draw in an Asian Cup semifinal tie on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Attendence: 30,000</p>
</text>
